" alt=\"\" />\n            <h3 className=\"text-base text-slate-900 font-medium mt-3\">Color Psychology in UI: How to Choose the Right Palette</h3>\n            <p className=\"text-xs text-indigo-600 font-medium mt-1\">UI/UX design</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n",
